  "description": "Orphaned at a young age, Estelle Serenity couldn't have made it without her childhood friend Rickert. People say there's no such thing as platonic relationships between a young man and a woman, but Estelle truly believes their sacred friendship will last forever... that is until one night at the masquerade, Estelle hooks up with a charming stranger. When she wakes up the next day in bed with none other than Rickert, Estelle must decide whether she'll protect her friendship or give this new thing a try... But Rickert seems to have other ideas, like a wolf drooling after a clueless ewe...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
